# LF everywhere, on every platform. Git for Windows defaults to CRLF in the
# working tree, which broke frontmatter parsing (Skills: 0 on the first
# Windows field test) and would corrupt install.sh under WSL. Text is LF;
# binaries are left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.onnx binary
*.wav binary
